.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-ls 1  "ngx-ls " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-ls \- List sites with status, SSL, renewal, ports and errors
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-ls\fR [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List sites with status, SSL, renewal, ports and errors
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-all\fR
Include disabled sites
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print JSON instead of a table
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  ngx ls
  ngx ls \-\-all          include disabled sites
  ngx ls \-\-json | jq \*(Aq.[] | select(.status == "down") | .domain\*(Aq
